    "message": "feat(mcp): annotate MCP tools with semantic hints\n\nClassify every advertised tool with readOnly/destructive/idempotent/openWorld\nhints so MCP clients can present and route them correctly. Graph reads are\nread-only and idempotent; ix_map/ix_ingest/ix_decide are destructive; only\nix_ingest is open-world because it reaches GitHub. The table is keyed by the\ntool catalog, so the typechecker rejects an unclassified addition. Hints are\nadvisory client metadata, not security controls — the runner's hardening is\nunchanged.",
